From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marlo <Plays.xenon@yahoo.de>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:36:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Editor pop-outs: dirty-driven redraw, event queue, monitor
 and main-window queries, id reuse, destroy-all at shutdown

Pop-out windows redraw on input, resize, invalidate and a 100 ms heartbeat instead of every frame (3 static pop-outs: 6.0 -> 4.15 ms).
New natives: ed_window_invalidate / set_title / set_defer_close / poll_event, ed_monitor_count / ed_monitor_info, ed_main_window_rect;
ed_window_get_rect also reports the monitor. Freed root-frame slots are reused. CScApp::Destroy closes all pop-outs before the UI manager goes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

